        <activityName xml:lang="en">Magnesium-alloy, AZ91, diecasting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Magnesium-alloy, AZ91, diecasting, at plant
Large uncertainties exist for data on energy use and SF6 emissions during magnesium diecasting. This inventory describes an assumption for the average production.;
UUID: 773fd4e8-5ca6-3af9-afc8-9d52c141231d
Diecasting process, no extra infrastructure.
Location: Data for 1 producer
Technology: Diecasting of AZ91, no recycling
Time period: Environmental report
Production volume: ca. 100000 t/a
Sampling: Environmental data from an important producer 
Extrapolations: From 1 producer to average Europe
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_773fd4e8-5ca6-3af9-afc8-9d52c141231d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
